<h1>🎬 NASKAH VIDEO RESMI &amp; STORYBOARD PER-SCENE</h1>
<div class="subtitle">EchoFactory: Industrial Acoustic AI &amp; Blockchain Machine Health Passport | COMPFEST 18 AIC (Smart Manufacturing)</div>

<div class="guide-box">
    <strong>📋 PANDUAN PRODUKSI VIDEO (PRODUCTION &amp; RECORDING GUIDELINES):</strong><br>
    • <strong>Target Durasi Total:</strong> <strong>04:00 Menit (240 Detik)</strong> (Sesuai batas maksimal video inovasi &lt; 5 menit pada Booklet COMPFEST Halaman 19).<br>
    • <strong>Format Video:</strong> MP4, Full HD 1080p (1920×1080), 60 FPS, Aspect Ratio 16:9, YouTube Visibility: Public.<br>
    • <strong>Format Judul Resmi YouTube:</strong> <code>COMPFEST18 AIC: Aku Mau Fokus Hima - EchoFactory</code><br>
    • <strong>Karakteristik Voiceover:</strong> Artikulasi lugas, percaya diri, intonasi dramatis pada problem $\rightarrow$ heroik dan presisi saat demonstrasi 10 pilar inovasi.<br>
    • <strong>Keterangan Tanda:</strong> <span class="pause">[JEDA]</span> = Hening 0.5 – 1 detik untuk sound effect / transisi visual.
</div>

